[
 {
  "i": 0,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Hero Garp is..."
 },
 {
  "i": 1,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "protecting the platform!"
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't get intimidated. It's just a name, you fools!"
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's just an old marine."
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Since you're part of his generation,"
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "you'd do well to pay attention to the enemy in front of you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Crimson Dog Bite!"
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You keep destroying the city..."
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Like I said, try to protect it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "style": "Title",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,200)}Monster"
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Make a path!"
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A path to Ace's rescue!"
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Those aggravating jerks came all the way here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Not gonna happen, you monster!"
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll show you the power of the New World!"
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "To the execution platform!"
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is it, Fire Fist?"
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace..."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Gol D. Roger?"
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You mean Gold Roger?"
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If I know him?"
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, don't you know why there's so many pirates causing trouble in the world?"
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's all that Roger-guy's fault!"
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Roger's..."
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is just what I've heard..."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but seems he spouted some crap about a\\N\"great treasure\" just before they executed him..."
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So generations of pirates stupid enough\\Nto believe him started roaming the seas."
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It'd be better if that guy was never born!"
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's scum!"
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "From the platform, before he died, he sent pirates out to sea to do whatever the hell they wanted!"
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He was trouble when he was alive, and he's even more so now that he's dead!"
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's the worst trash in the world! Remember that!"
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh? What's wrong?"
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why are you getting so upset?"
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Say, who are you anyway, you little runt?"
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What were you doing down in the village, Ace?"
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's a huge uproar down there because some delinquents were almost killed by a kid."
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What? And here I thought they were dead."
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?! When you cause trouble, I'm the one who gets blamed, you know!"
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You listening to me, Ace?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sheesh! How could he push\\Nsuch a troublemaker on me?"
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You want to know about Roger, you say?"
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He was..."
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "just a liar and a murderer!"
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "\"Pirate King\"? Don't make me laugh!"
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He wasn't the Pirate King, more like the Bullshit King!"
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can say that again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Roger?"
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't say such disgusting\\Nnames, kid. You'll spoil my beer."
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Get lost."
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why're you lookin' at me like that?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey! What are you doing, you damn brat?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why are you looking so beat down?"
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Looks like you've been causing a lot of trouble lately."
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Gramps..."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You have a grandson, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Does he seem happy to you?"
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, you mean Luffy?"
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm raising him well."
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Gramps."
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Was it..."
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "good that I was born?"
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, you..."
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As long as you're alive, you'll figure it out eventually."
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry and bring Straw Hat-boy to the ship!"
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now that it's come to this, vwe'll just have to save Ace-boy vourselves!"
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Iva{\\i1}-chan{\\i0}..."
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vyou're still conscious?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I have one last favor to ask of you..."
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just a little further! We're coming now, Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Clear a path!"
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm..."
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Dammit!"
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace{\\i1}-san{\\i0}, wait for me! I will save you even if it costs me my life!"
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Almost there!"
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here we come, Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace! We'll definitely save you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait for us, Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't you dare give up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Dammit! What's wrong with me?! This isn't the time to..."
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pops, my brother and my crew..."
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "are falling, and yet..."
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "\"One last favor\"?! Don't say such ominous things!"
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please, give me..."
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm so happy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "my tears won't stop..."
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Even now that it's come to this..."
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I want to live..."
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Captain Buggy, you're awake!"
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're alive!"
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thank goodness!"
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What happened to me?"
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(0,350)}You were frozen by that Aokiji-guy."
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh no!"
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hear me, Navy! You'd better prepare yourselves!"
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't think I'm the kind of man who'll let it end with this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah! We'll get our revenge before long! I'd expect no less from you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Indeed, my friend!"
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But... what am I gonna do?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Move it, Magma-brat!"
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn it to Hell..."
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pops!"
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So even you can't fight old age, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whitebeard!"
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The one thing we'd feared the most..."
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You want me to wear this equipment so the enemy will feel sorry for me or something?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pops..."
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The battle is over once you let your guard down, even for a second!"
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Marco!"
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You just got distracted, didn't you?"
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Jozu!"
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, I guess it's time for me to send you off to the next world!"
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pops!"
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, Pops..."
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vyou want another shot of the Tension Hormones?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's too reckless!"
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's hopeless! Vyou and Vi fought our way out of Impel Down together, didn't vwe?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vyour body has been fatally poisoned and\\Nthen brought back from the brink of death..."
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's way beyond its limits!"
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Didn't Vi tell you before? The Tension Hormones are nothing but an emergency treatment!"
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If Vi keep deceiving vyour body, vyou really will die after this is all over!"
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As long as I've done all I can,"
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "then I don't mind dying!"
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please let me fight, Iva{\\i1}-chan{\\i0}!"
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pops was done in!"
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Marco! Jozu!"
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If... I don't fight here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If... I can't save Ace..."
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll..."
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "end up wanting to die!"
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please... Give me the power to fight!"
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And Vi'm telling vyou..."
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If Vi allow vyou to die, Vi won't be able to show my face to Dragon afterwards!"
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vyou ignorant fool!"
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace..."
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fine!"
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do whatever the hell..."
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "vyou want!"
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, you! What are you doing to Straw Hat?"
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "S-Straw Hat's..."
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-Impossible! I thought he was on the verge of death after taking Kizaru{\\i1}-san's{\\i0} attack head-on!"
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat-boy, once again, you better keep in mind..."
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "that the next time you drop, you won't be able to bounce back!"
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Those guys!"
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait!"
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're trying to execute Ace again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, well, my words can't change Straw Hat-boy's mind under these circumstances!"
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All I can do is keep them from beating him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat is coming!"
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Kill Straw Hat!"
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm gonna finish him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's not over! I won't let you pass through here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If you wanna advance..."
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You gotta beat all of us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll show you the spirit of the Navy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Heads up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Death Wink!"
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "10 points! I'll back you up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thanks, Ivan{\\i1}-chan{\\i0}!"
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy{\\i1}-san{\\i0}..."
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Koby!"
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's right! In order to\\Nlive as a Navy soldier,"
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I have to fight to change myself!"
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Because this is a battlefield!"
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I have to commit myself towards killing him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Rubber-Rubber..."
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Shave!"
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Bullet!"
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's as strong as I thought..."
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is it this time?!"
 },
 {
